*VERSION: 3.0
*WRITTEN_BY: openair-conformance
* Tests: sun events in weekday AA commands: SR/SS, SS/SR, BCMT/EECT, and a fixed time with SS that keeps its order in the date range.

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 1
AA SR/SS
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 2
AA SS/SR
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 3
AA SAT,SUN BCMT/EECT
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:10:00E
DP 45:55:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E

AC D
AY TRA
AN Example TRA 4
AA MON-FRI 07:00Z/SS 2026-04-01/2026-09-30
AH 4500 FT AMSL
AL GND
DP 46:00:00N 014:00:00E
DP 46:00:00N 014:10:00E
